Package: mldonkey-server
Architecture: any
Provides: mldonkey
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, init-system-helpers (>= 1.52)
Description: MLDonkey multi-network server, ported to OCaml 5
 Background server for eDonkey, Kad, Overnet, BitTorrent, Direct Connect,
 Fasttrack and HTTP/FTP. Controlled through a separate frontend such as
 KMLDonkey, or the built-in web interface.
 This independent fork is based on MLDonkey 3.2.1.
